      ],
      "text": "An orchestrator LLM delegates to a team of agents via tool calls; two implementations are described: ClaudeCodeOrchestrator (running on Claude Code with agents as MCP tools) and ApiOrchestrator on the Anthropic or Gemini API."
    },
