      "text": "Configuration flags include --team (full default, quick, test), --exchanges, --cycles, --orchestrator (api default, or claude-code/gemini-cli/codex/cursor), --orchestrator-model, --effort, --skip-intake, --auto-refine, --json, and --no-auto-commit."
    },
