        "slc_f5fb72f331fd74d9dd84afea4221ca341752ad3369af1228a7e1aca80cbadece"
      ],
      "text": "Cost tracking separates an API bucket of real pay-per-token spend (e.g. ~$0.13/run for a Gemini Flash orchestrator) from a Virtual bucket showing what subscription-covered worker usage would have cost, which is not actually charged."
