      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1bf33858ff289a054929beaa43e7d0d71d6fa3b0344171bbdbca4f13103af179"
      ],
      "text": "Four effort levels (low, standard, high, max) scale both orchestrator behavior and verification strictness, from basic test-passing checks up to skeptical rejection of technically correct but mediocre work."
